        "I appreciate that.",
        "Glad the system worked."
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "SORRY",
      "priority": 15,
      "patterns": [
        ["sorry"],
        ["i", "am", "sorry"],
        ["my", "bad"],
        ["my", "mistake"]
      ],
      "responses": [
        "No problem.",
        "It's okay.",
        "No worries."
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "QUESTION_WHY",
      "priority": 12,
      "patterns": [
        ["why"],
        ["why", "is", "that"],
        ["why", "does", "that", "happen"],
        ["why", "did", "that", "happen"]
      ],
      "responses": [
        "That depends on the context. Give me a little more information.",
        "I need more context to determine why.",
        "Tell me what you're referring to and I'll analyze it."
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "QUESTION_WHAT",
      "priority": 10,
      "patterns": [
        ["what"],
        ["what", "is", "that"],
        ["what", "is", "this"],
        ["what", "does", "that", "mean"]
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Tell me what you're referring to and I'll explain it.",
        "I can help explain that. Give me the specific topic."
